    "name": {
      "value": "Greater Trickster's Mandolin"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Sought after by many unscrupulous bards, this instrument is surprisingly light and easy to carry, but also empowered with a number of spells carefully selected to help with fooling others or making a hasty retreat. While playing the mandolin, you gain a +1 item bonus to Deception and Performance checks.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n\nYou change the instrument's color and shape to one you prefer, and you can turn it into a different handheld string instrument that takes two hands to play.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from this instrument to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- - **2nd:** illusory creature, illusory disguise, invisibility, mirror image\n- - **3rd:** illusory disguise, phantom prison, sculpt sound"
    },
